From {{inh|en|enm|dronknen}}, {{m|enm|drunkenen}}, {{m|enm|drunknen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|druncnian|t=to drown; get drunk}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*drunkanōną|t=to get drunk}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*drunkanaz|t=drunk; intoxicated}}. Cognate with {{cog|no|drukne}}, {{m|no|drukna}}, {{cog|is|drukna}}.

